# ── The BBA treatment (general.style=bba), probed with bba-cli (see
# responses.notes.md, "BBA treatment (2026-09-24)"). Constructed hands
# are probes; the others are Basic_* deals where BBA bids the same.
card    Basic-Bridge general.style=bba
dealer  S
# three trumps: 2M up to 10 flat, 3M 11-12 flat or 9-11 with shortness
N 432.K32.QJ2.A432      | 1S P    | 2S     | bba: three trumps, flat 10: raise (probe)
