N 9743.J5.KQ8.AJT2      | 1S P    | 2C     | bba: four trumps and 11: a new suit (Basic_Major 185)
# over 1H with three hearts and four spades: 1S from 11, or 10 and a doubleton
N K32.5432.J32.A32      | 1H P    | 2H     | bba: 8, three spades and four hearts: raise (probe)
N AJ43.J42.A98.T98      | 1H P    | 2H     | bba: flat 10, three hearts: raise, not 1S (Basic_Major 65)
N KQ32.432.Q32.A32      | 1H P    | 1S     | bba: 11 with three hearts: 1S first (probe)
