# 2/1 game force (2026-09-30): on a 2/1 card the two-over-one is game
# forcing with opening values (BBA from 13 HCP; ours 13 points with 12
# HCP), and the 1NT response is 6-12, forcing when the card says so.
card    21GF-DEFAULT
dealer  N
S 72.K84.A73.AQ952      | 1S P                                 | 2C     | 13 HCP: two over one, game forcing
S 72.K84.Q73.AQ952      | 1S P                                 | 1NT    | 11 HCP: forcing 1NT, not a 2/1
S 74.T84.A9.AKT743      | 1D P                                 | 3C     | six clubs, 11 HCP: short of the game-forcing 2C
card    21GF-GIB
S 72.K84.Q73.AQ952      | 1S P                                 | 1NT    | a 2/1 card without forcing 1NT: 1NT 6-12
card    Basic-Bridge
S 72.K84.Q73.AQ952      | 1S P                                 | 2C     | Standard American: 2C from 11, forcing one round

